/// Writes `state + 0x0C`, installs a special callback, clears
/// [`SDA_DVD_4D50`] and may invoke `state + 0x28` and [`SDA_DVD_4CE0`] with two
/// arguments. On the reset path it initialises [`DVD_RETRY_ALARM_A`] and arms
/// the callback label `0x801CB1A0`.
