/// * `file_info` - descriptor receiving the command block.
/// * `dst` - destination buffer.
/// * `len` - transfer length.
/// * `start` - start sector/word.
/// * `callback` - per-transfer completion function.
/// * `prio` - queue priority passed to `0x801CFAB0`.
///
/// # Returns
/// The result of `0x801CFAB0(prio, file_info)`.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Writes `+8`, `+0x18`, `+0x14`, `+0x10`, `+0x20`, `+0x28` and `+0x0C` of the
/// descriptor; may invalidate the destination cache range through
/// `0x801AC440`; may restart the state machine through `0x801CDA10`.
