///
/// # Returns
/// `true` when the ioctl was queued, `false` on failure or a busy context.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Claims a context, writes command byte `0x8A` and the timer-hook word
/// [`SDA_DVD_4C88`] at `+4`, and submits
/// `IOS_IoctlAsync(fd, 0x8A, cmd, 0x20, 0, 0, 0x801D1060, ctx)`.
