/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801d28e0_FUN_801d28e0.c`
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `a` - first command payload word (`+4`).
/// * `b` - second command payload word (`+8`).
/// * `callback` - completion stored in the ioctl context.
///
/// # Returns
/// `true` when the ioctl was queued.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Claims a context, advances the command ring, writes command byte `0xE4`,
/// and submits
/// `IOS_IoctlAsync(fd, 0xE4, cmd, 0x20, 0x80395C60, 0x20, 0x801D1060, ctx)`.
