///   [`DVD_STATE_DEFAULT`] and invokes its callback.
/// * May arm the delayed-retry alarm through [`dvd_arm_retry_alarm`], record
///   event `0x27`, or start the error-log/retry helpers.
/// * State kinds `0x24`/`0x26` consult the cover word from `0x801D3250`;
///   kind `0x28` compares/copies the 0x20-byte partition header block.
///
/// # Safety
/// All state objects, callbacks and the partition header pointer stored in
/// [`SDA_DVD_4CD4`] must be valid.
