/// Removes one user block from the tag list selected by the [`HEAP_ROOT`]
/// search and zeroes its first word.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801d3b80` at `0x801D3B80` (364 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801d3b80_FUN_801d3b80.c`
