/// Splits one free-list record into the front/back right subrecords.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801d3e30` at `0x801D3E30` (556 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801d3e30_FUN_801d3e30.c`
/// - Called by [`fn_801d4060`] (flag 0) and [`fn_801d4140`] (flag 1).
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `list` - free-list head pair (`+0` front, `+4` back) from the prologue.
/// * `node` - free record being split, from the prologue.
/// * `base` - byte offset just past the user header (`param_3`).
/// * `size` - right-edge address (`param_4`).
/// * `flag` - left/right subrecord selector (`param_5`).
///
/// # Returns
/// The new user-header address (`node + aligned`).
///
/// # Side effects
/// Relinks `node` into the `list` pair, optionally writes `FR` subrecords
/// (offset size `0x4652`, `+0x10` link), zeroes the user region with
/// `memset` when `list[-1] & 1`, writes the `DU` tag and size, appends the
/// new record at `list + 0x08` (`+0x0C`/`+8` links).
///
