/// Coalesces one free-list region back into a single `FR` record.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801d4210` at `0x801D4210` (360 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801d4210_FUN_801d4210.c`
