/// * `heap` - heap descriptor.
/// * `size` - requested size; the absolute value is used.
///
/// # Returns
/// The largest `free - aligned` size, or `0` when nothing fits.
///
/// # Side effects
/// Locks `heap + 0x20` when `+0x38 & 4`; otherwise read-only.
///
/// # Safety
