/// One-shot DSP task-layer initialisation.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801d5740` at `0x801D5740` (192 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801d5740_FUN_801d5740.c`
