/// links it before the first node with a larger `+4` key (rewriting the
/// predecessor's `+0x3C`, its own `+0x38`/`+0x3C`, the successor's `+0x38`
/// and [`SDA_DSP_ACTIVE`] when it becomes the head), else appends it at the
/// tail and rewrites [`SDA_DSP_TAIL`].
