///   per-stage arrays).
/// * `enabled` - one-bit enable; when zero the routine returns after the mask
///   update.
/// * `width` - width minus one, stored in the low half of `+0x108`.
/// * `height` - height minus one, stored in the low half of `+0x128`.
///
