/// Emits the packed `0x61` indirect-texture command word and caches it.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801c8dc0` at `0x801C8DC0` (80 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801c8dc0_FUN_801c8dc0.c`
