/// Reads the four-byte settings item `id` into `out`.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801dca70` at `0x801DCA70` (212 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801dca70_FUN_801dca70.c`
///
/// # Arguments
