/// Resets the derived texture fields and marks them dirty.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801c4070` at `0x801C4070` (52 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801c4070_FUN_801c4070.c`
///
/// # Arguments
