/// Builds a look-at basis matrix from an eye point, an up hint and a target.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801c0da0` at `0x801C0DA0` (372 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801c0da0_FUN_801c0da0.c`
