/// Reads the GX channel state back into seven words.
///
/// # Original
/// - Ghidra: `FUN_801c9900` at `0x801C9900` (64 bytes)
/// - Evidence: `work/ghidra/main-gb/export/801c9900_FUN_801c9900.c`
